Package: distsamp
Title: Segment Aerial Line-Transect Survey Data for Distance Sampling
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Camille", "Ross", , "camille.ross@maine.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Turns marine mammal aerial line-transect survey data recorded in the
    North Atlantic Right Whale Consortium (NARWC) sightings database format into
    effort segments suitable for distance sampling and density surface modeling.
    Provides NARWC schema validation, on-effort determination, great-circle effort
    accumulation, splitting of survey lines at breaks in effort, and chopping of
    continuous tracklines into segments of a target length following the approach
    of Becker and colleagues.
